**Verdict:** The lab scenario at $10k satisfies all 4 Prong Rules and reads as an $18k+ ring. The natural scenario at $70k is the proper way to buy 3ct natural — stone + full-protection setting. Trying to buy 3ct natural with a cheap setting is Mistake 3 from the 2ct guide applied at a bigger scale.

