**Verdict:** 3ct marquise is the "statement tier" — the carat weight that reads unmistakably as "big engagement ring." On natural, the price jump from 2.5ct to 3ct is steep (60%+) for modest size gain. On lab, the jump is only $536 — easy stretch for the extra carat weight on the certificate.

