><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29430286?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$117,909</a></td><td>Max-prestige natural at $62k premium over honest-value pick.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Natural ceiling (3.38ct)</strong></td><td>GIA 3.38ct D-FL Ideal</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28505181?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$124,199</a></td><td>Natural market ceiling. Largest carat + max cert.</td></tr></tbody></table>

